  "body": "Our sellers have a deadline to beat and if this property isn't sold at auction or before they'll be holding tight and it'll be going into the rental market. So if you've been dreaming of an easy, laid-back beachy lifestyle, you're going to want to come and see this one pronto! Throw a towel over your shoulder, wander down to Red Beach, or head to the surf club on a Friday night for one of Krave Catering's famous platters. With shops, schools, parks, and the brand new pump track all close by, there's lots to love about this location.\r\n\r\nEven better is that all the hard work has been done. A stunning new kitchen, two beautifully renovated bathrooms, fresh flooring, new carpet, updated lighting and fresh paint give the home a crisp, modern feel. Outside, the roof and exterior have been professionally repainted, while practical upgrades throughout add comfort and peace of mind.\r\n\r\nFeatures you'll love\r\n* Just a 700m stroll along Bay Street to Red Beach\r\n* Freshly renovated throughout with quality finishes\r\n* Stunning new kitchen with new appliances\r\n* Two beautifully renovated bathrooms: new showers, vanities, toilets, tiling and fittings\r\n* New laundry fit-out and washing line\r\n* Solidly constructed in brick and weatherboard\r\n* Easy care section with lots of offstreet parking\r\n* New carpet throughout, including the garage\r\n* New timber flooring in key living areas\r\n* New hot water cylinder\r\n* Fresh interior paint, new curtains and blinds throughout\r\n* Upgraded stairwell with timber feature and refreshed balustrade\r\n* New lighting throughout and upgraded switchboard\r\n* Heat pump and insulation improvements for year-round comfort\r\n* Exterior and roof professionally repainted\r\n* Renovation project managed by a Licensed Building Practitioner with qualified tradespeople engaged throughout\r\n\r\nThis is a location families and beach lovers never want to leave. Enjoy the convenience of having excellent schools, shops, motorway access and everything you need within easy reach. It's relaxed, friendly and exactly the kind of lifestyle people love about the coast.\r\n\r\nTo download the property documents please visit: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/87YP\r\n\r\n- Flexible settlement terms available\r\n- Other agents bring your buyers, conjunctionals welcome\r\n- Building report available",
